  - m_Id: 6720211339173888
    m_Localized: Letter from Pa Nolan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6720839771742208
    m_Localized: "Declan, I wish I could\u2019ve been here to welcome you back after 5 years but Half Bottle started choking on a Peanut so we took him down to the CareDoc.\r\n\r\nSo since you\u2019ve been away up in Dublin things have changed in Toberduff. Myself, Tubs Devlin and Half Bottle lost it all during the crash there. We\u2019re getting just enough to stay alive off the Dole but it\u2019s tight enough. \r\n\r\nI\u2019ve put a Pay-As-You-Go electricity meter into the shed oh and by the way the bank took everything so we\u2019re set up in the shed, don\u2019t worry there's a mattress for you too.\r\n\r\nTo be honest with you your only real chance is getting to Australia to earn proper money on the mines or building sites.\r\n\r\nBut you need at least \u20AC5,000 before your working visa window closes, so you have put together a rough crew of local currach racers to win the big money Sunday races.\r\n\r\nWe can be that crew for you, just keep my palm greased and I\u2019m happy.\r\n\r\n-Pa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
